<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">2 BaKorinti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2BaK</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 BaKorinti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung kufɛ́ afa fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aKorinti</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 BaKorinti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung kufɛ́ afaa fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aKorinti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni bɔk hom aBulus, atom fɛ́ aYeso Kristi kasa ni kushim Adakunom, nɛ aruneng yit aTimoti, sak na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aKorinti ni isherep banet Adakunom fɛ́ ba se ni mben Akaya ngma kusum: <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Won itek ni kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ni ku sot kufiin.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adakunom fɛ́ a rēn ki <optbreak /> gbinding yit makiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Won iratek ni i sot ifɛ̀ Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, Ada fɛ̀ a foos angmishish, iwu fɛ̀ a ki wɔrɔk yit, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />ni izen mgbang, nɔng iyit da kyem in di gbinding yit bayɔng fɛ̀ ba sɛ ayit izot, ni kuri iwɔrɔk fɛ̀ Adakunom ki gbinding yit mo bá. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Nek ki in sɔ yit mgbang aKristi, nek in yet yit bafuu, anɔng wu fi in sɛs yit gbinding anɔng bá. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ki iyit tsin sɔ yit mgbang, in tsin nye yit anɔng, nɔng iyin di sɛ igbingding ni isheshek; ki iyit tsin sɛs yit igbingding, a sot iyin mi se yin gbinding nek akabɔk ni tsesek fi i nye yin ni izen mgbang yit. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />In bɛ́ yit ite iyɛ ni yin makiyi, nek in rēn yit fok, ti i di sɔ yin mgbang gung ni iyit, i da sɛ yin imen iyɛ fi in tsin sɛs yit bá.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ábaruneng, iyit shim ni rēn yin tsɛngtsɛng, naton kuri izot fi in tsin sɔ yit na Asiya awo, nek izot e tsi iwat agap yit, fi i sak in di nɔk yit nwaa kutset yit. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Nek in di yit tɛ ba mi ki tsɛɛt yit ishɔt iku, awɛt ikyɛng e te anɔng, kɔn in bi te yɛndɛng yit ni kukyem yit, tit na Adakunom iwu fɛ́ a kyem a doro na bafaben. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Iwu fɛ́ a ki tun yit ni izot iku dɔng. Ni wu fi in di te yit iyɛ fok a da tɛ a ki tun yit bá. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Ise gbing-gbing iyin ni i ki ses yit mo na awon, nɔng banet dot di ki nesek ifeng akuce yit nek ishashang awon banet dot.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus shesheng irèn itseet wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Nek itsot kugwɔm yit yet fok, iyit rēn yit na ayɛ yit fok, in nye yit kusot kutek na banet azatse, vit itonoso kutsitsɛng azatse tit kunang Adakunom, imak e ni izen fi in se yit gung ni iyin. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Nek kaban fumung kang fi in tsin ki jɛk yin ne yet kuyɔng fi i da kyem i fa yin ni rēn yin iko, ite iyɛ hom yet fok, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />ti fi i ki rēn yit gyegyet yɔkɔnɔng, i bi tsot yin kugwɔm ni iyit, ni iyit tsot yit kugwɔm ni iyin atuk fɛ́ aYeso bi bes wu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Nek imi rēn anɔng wu fi in shim in tin bɛ́ azɔng narɔ yin ninyen, nɔng iyin da ti i sɛ yin awɛng e afɛ́ afaa. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />In shim in got azɔng narɔ yin, in bi ni in tatɔk sak na aMasedoniya, ama fi in ne na aMasedoniya, in bi tin got azɔng, nɔng i bi di te yin ni rèn sak na aJudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Iyin di yin ti in nyes nkyɔrɔk kpɛɛ yɛ? Ke i di yin ti ras nkyɔrɔk tɛ banet azatse fɛ́ ba nye, &lt;&lt;Ey, ey&gt;&gt; nɛ &lt;&lt;Awey, awey&gt;&gt; ni izen izining ɛ?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ Adakunom di yet a fɛ́ atsak, ifɛ́ yit sak ni yin mang yet ifɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Ey&gt;&gt; nɛ &lt;&lt;Awey&gt;&gt; ni izen izining awo. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Nek aRim Adakunom, aYeso Kristi, ayɔng fi iyit shara yit ifɛ́ wu nate yin, imi nɛ aSilvanus nɛ aTimoti, ifɛ́ me ki mang yet aEy nɛ aWey awo tit Ey kyek kaakyi izen ayɛt wu. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Nek ngma nkyɔrɔk fɛ̀ Adakunom man fɛ́ a bi nye, in ses ishining ayɛt aYeso. Nek anɔng wu in di shish yit Anɔng sak na Adakunom nek ízɔk wu. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Iwu Adakunom fɛ̀ a ki te tsik yit ni iyin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, iwu fɛ̀ a di korok name ni yit, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />a tɛ di te nagang wu naton yit, a ki te yit Kabik wu a ki yit yit mo sak ni ikyɛng fi i bi bɛ́ ashon.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Adakunom wu fɛ̀ a yet anet icɛɛt hom, ki ikyɛng fi i di ro ni ibɛ́ na aKorinti yet nek in di kyɛk ikɔn fi in bɛ nek iyin. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Ayet fok in shim in ki tonong yin igwɔm naton inɔɔk atsak yin awo, tit ni in nye yit ikyɛng fi i da ki bɛ́ yin na kafa kakan, nek i da bang nyeseng yin gbagba ayɛt inɔɔk atsak yin.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Nek anɔng, in mi sok ni iyɛ hom, in da ti in ki bɛ́ yin itsen fi i da ki beseng yin iyɛ awo. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Nek ki imi ki beseng yin iyɛ, angan tɛ a di se fɛ́ a di ki bɛ́ ni itɛrɛk iyɛ ɛ tit ayɔng fi in mi ku beseng iyɛ me. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />In ki jɛk yin e anɔng, nek kin in bi in ta azɔng, in bi sɔ mgbang ni bɔk bayɔng fi i se yɛɛt ba di nɔk nta awo. Nek imi rēn tsɛngtsɛng fok kin in bɛ́ iyɛ ikan, iyin da bɛ́ yin iyɛ ikan bá. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Nek imi ki jɛk in e, ayɛt ibeseng iyɛ nɛ kafa kawe nɛ nayisi makiyi, da in ki jɛk kin ne nek in ki beseng yin iyɛ awo tit nek in ki tonong yin kutsik ishim fi in bɛ̀ nek iyin.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifuut anɛn nek afi inɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ke akak nye ikyɛng fi ibeseng anet akak iyɛ, imi wu fɛ́ a di beseng iyɛ awo, awɛt imi di tɛ abak kayɔng ngma yit wu a ki beseng yit ne, imi mak shim in di ban ni icɛɛt e awo. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Nek itabak fɛ́ anet yɔng mi sɔ ni bɔk yin mi kyem anɔng. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Awɛt itabak e anɔng, ba ku fuut ne kong, ku gbinding yin kong kɔng kafa kawe me bi dung ku mak. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />In tsin ra awon ni yin fok ku tonong ishim kong. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Nek anɔng wu in di jɛk, nek in di rēn nyen ifoos yin ikyɛng fi in ki tas yin kaakyi izen ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ngma ayɔng fi iyin ku fuut yin ne, imi ku fuut e bà. Wat ikyɛng fi imi fuut ide, ki iyet ifi fuut, in nye anɔng akuce yin, i sɛ kusonong ashon Anet-Isheshek, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kɔn aShetan bi nye ikyɛng fɛ̀ a da ki borok yit mo; nek iyit yet yit batsen ni irèn iras nkyɔrɔk wu awo.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awɛng ayɛt Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Izen fi in ki tse na aTorowas nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek aKristi, ngma ni itarak katitu ni irèn fɛ́ aTisa di nɔɔk, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />iyɛ hom rēn se diring nek in bit aruneng aTitus azɔng, nek anɔng, in te a tɔ ni iba, in tatɔk sak na aMasedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Won in tere yit Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a ki kɔk yit kubɔk na ki yɛs yit irèn kaakyi izen ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, na ra kutomong ni iyit kaakɛ ni ishara yit ifɛ̀ wu fi i bi nkɔn ntek makiyi. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Nek iyit ba in yet yit nkɔn ntek fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek nabak sak na Adakunom, fi in se yit ni kutomong nate bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin ka ba sheshek, nate bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin wɛɛs, <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />sak na bakak, in yet yit nkɔn iku, sak na bakak bá in yet yit nkɔn nhwyɔlɔl sak ni kutsɛt. Angan da kyem acet ndiring kutomong ti kuyɔng ɛ? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Nek iyit da in se yit ti ishɛrɛp banet awo, bayɔng fɛ́ ba res ifɛ̀ Adakunom nek ba di sɛs kurúm, iyit yet yit banet atsak, bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ki kasa yit, ne agap fi in sɛs na Anet-Isheshek in di cɛɛt ashon Adakunom ayɛt atsak, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom ka ba tom.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Banet itomong Kushi kufas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />In da kpa yit itere yit ice yit kong ɛ? Ke in da kpa tsɛsɛk yit afumung itere ni yin, ke ni iyit ki nesek yin afumung itere kyɔn tɛ bakak di ras ɛ? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Iyin ace yin, i yet yit afumung itere yit, fɛ́ ba mi jɛk na ayɛ yit, fɛ́ ngma banet da rēn na ba fa. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Iyin mi tonong yin wɛshɛk fok iyin yet yin afumung fɛ́ a ne na Anet-Isheshek fɛ́ a yet kutomong fi in ra yit, ayɔng fɛ́ da ba jɛk na name ijɛk awo tit ayɔng fɛ́ ba jɛk na Kabik Adakunom afi kutset, ayɔng fɛ́ da ba jɛk naton afak ata awo tit ayɔng fɛ́ ba jɛk ina na ayɛ banet awe.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />In cɛɛt yit anɔng, nek agap iyɛ fɛ́ Adakunom ki nesek yit ayɛt aKristi. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Vit iyit ni ikyɛng fi i da tonong fok in nye yit anɔng na agap ice yit tit in ses yit kukyem yit na Adakunom, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />iwu fɛ́ a ki nɔɔk yit kukyem isot banet itomong kushi kufas, bafi ntsi ijɛk awo tit bafɛ́ abik. Nek ntsi fɛ́ ba jɛk ina fi in bɛ̀ ni iku awɛt Kabik ka ka bɛ̀ ni kutset.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Ke anet itomong iku, fɛ́ ba kin ta naton afak ata, kyem a bɛ́ ni mgbey Adakunom naton aMusa fi i sak nnon aIsrela kyem na yɛrɛ ayisi wu awo, kuri mgbey yɔng fi in bi nkum, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />wat iyin di yin tɛ kutomong abik fi mgbey na se gyet awo bi wat kufi ntsi ijɛk awɛ? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ki izen ntsi ijɛk kin bɛ̀ mgbey anɔng, ni iku ma ya banet ni ishɔt; kutomong abik fi ku wat mgbey ye yɔng, nek ku bi sas banet kusot kutabat ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Nek ki ikyɛng fi i man ni i bɛ̀ mgbey, mi sot idɔng fi i se vit mgbey hwyiri-hwyiri, nek mgbey ikak fi i wat idɔng mi bɛ́. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Nek ki kushii fi ku nye shuut kin bɛ̀ ni mgbey anɔng, awɛt kushi fi ku mi bɛ wat kushi kuyɔng fi ku tsin te shuut, ni mgbey makiyi.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Nek anɔng, fi in bɛ̀ yit ite iyɛ anɔng, fi in di cɛɛt yit na agap iyɛ, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />da kuri ifɛ́ aMusa fɛ́ a kin fam ayisi wu ni icɛk ikpin kɔn nnon aIsrela bi yɛrɛ igang mgbey e fi i tseng sak igang awo. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Awɛt ayɛ bà kin se kashalang, fi ite sak atut, ke ba tsin fa kushi kuzen e, na ba rēn yɛrɛ icɛk ikpin e rēn resek mo, nek kukyem itun icɛk ikpin e nes na Anet-Isheshek kyɛk. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Nkum izen e yɔng sak atut, ki ba tsin fa ijɛk aMusa, ni icɛk ikpin e ka ba nye gyip ayɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Izen fɛ́ anet tirik sak na aTisa, na ba tun icɛk ikpin e. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Kɔ di yin, aTisa wu fɛ́ a yet Kabik e, karɔ fɛ́ Kabik aTisa di se, kaakyi ikyɛng se washak. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Ngma yit fɛ́ ba mi ki tun yit icek ikpin na ayisi, in yɛrɛ yit mgbey aTisa, a tsin ki shesheng yit ni nse aTisa ni mgbey wu di barasa ni iyit na ayɛ yit, kashon sak kashon, fɛ́ a yet Kabik e.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Kurúm ayɛt kutsung irɔp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nek anɔng, ayet fok in bɛ̀ yit kutomong fɛ́ Adakunom ki nɔɔk yit nek angmishish wu, nek anɔng in da te yit nwaa awo. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />In mi kana kam yit ni ntomong inɛt nfi nborok ni nsum. In da tin boroso yit banet awo, ke ni in wɔrɔsɔ yit banet ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom awo tit in itas atsak wɛshɛk, na anɔng wu kaangan di ki di atsak yit nanu ashon Adakunom ayit iyɛ wu. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Ki ishara ifɛ̀ itek deng fi in se yit ne se ni ifam, i se ni ifaam na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni ibeseng. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Kaban-nnom azatse kang mi ka ba te ngmaat ayɛ bà tɛ bafi nhwyi, ba tɛ ba di mgbey ifɛ̀ itek ízɔk Anet-Isheshek fɛ́ a yet nawu Adakunom awo. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Nek ikyɛng fi in shara yit yet in di tonong yit ace yit awo tit aYeso Kristi fɛ́ a yet aTisa yit, wat iyit yet yit basam fɛ́ ba tsin ki ra yin kutomong akuce wu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Nek Adakunom kin fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Won mgbey ni iron ayɛt ahwyi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Imɛsɛng 1:3</ref></char>.</note> A mi te mgbey e tsin ron ayɛt ayɛ yit, ni in nesek yit irēn mgbey Adakunom fi in se na ayisi aYeso Kristi.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ngma na anɔng, in bɛ̀ yit kurúm kang ayɛt atsung irɔp, nɔng ba di ki tonong fok agap aratek-aratek nes na Adakunom da ni yit awo. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Ba ki nesek yit izot na kaakyɛ abak, ngma na anɔng ba mi kyem ba ki fɛlɛ yit awo; ba ki bushung yit nkap, ngma na anɔng in mi nɔɔk yit nwaa awo; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />ba ki nesek yit iyɔm, ngma na anɔng Adakunom mi te burum ni iyit awo. Ba tɛn na ba ki carak yit sak aben, ngma na anɔng in kus yit awo; <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />in sok yit iku aYeso ni irɔm kaakyi izen nek kutomong aYeso, nɔng ayɛt anɔng banet bin di sɛs kutset fi ku nes na aYeso. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Nek iyit fi in se yit ni kutset, kaakyi izen in se yit nanu iku nek aYeso, nɔng banet di ki sɛs kutset fi ku nes na aYeso ni irɔm yit fi in kus yit. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Nek anɔng iku se ni kutomong nate yit, awɛt ni kutset se ni kutomong nate yin.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />I se ni ijɛk ni ifɛ̀ Adakunom ye, &lt;&lt;Imi shan atsak, yɔk anɔng in di fɛ̀.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Abom 116:10</ref></char>.</note> Ayet fok in bɛ̀ yit kuri kabik ishan atsak kazining, anɔng fi in di shan yit atsak, nek anɔng in tsin di cɛɛt yit. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />In rēn yit fok iwu fɛ́ a kin donong aTisa yit aYeso, a bi ki donong yit gung na aYeso, a bi tse ni iyit ngma ni iyin nanu ashon wu. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ba nye nkyɔrɔk nang ngma nek itek yin, nɔng ki kunang Adakunom bin di barasa isɛs banet, ida ban di barasa ifeng banet dot, ba da bang tere Adakunom.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Nek anɔng, in nesek yit nwaa awo. Ngma ni fi nrɔm yit nang fɛ́ banet yɛrɛ mi gyɔt, ngma na anɔng na kabik yit woso isɛs agap atut na katson. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Nek mgbang fi in tsin sɔ yit kyɔrɔng, in tsin ki nye yit sak kusot nta ayɛ na ayɛ fi ku se ashon makiyi, fɛ́ vit ikyɛng fɛ́ ba di ki mara ina. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ki in tun yit ayisi ni nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ayisi tsin yɛrɛ, in di ki nak yit iyɛrɛ in yɔng fɛ́ ayisi kyem a di awo, nek nkyɔrɔk fi in tsin yɛrɛ yit tsin gosok, awɛt in yɔng fi da in yɛrɛ yit awo yet in yɔng fɛ́ da in bi nkum awo.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Karɔ isot yit azanɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Nek iyit rēn yit fok ke ba fo kutɔmɔng<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:8">Iwuruk 25:8</ref></char>.</note> kang fi in di sosok azatse, in bɛ̀ yit inok ikak narɔ Adakunom, kari fɛ́ da ba nok ika ni mbɔk awo, kari azanɛn fɛ́ ka sot ayɛ na ayɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Nek in woso tsɛt yit kutɔmɔng ku kang ni rus, a ki se yit ki in mi nɔ yit ari yit ka fɛ́ azanɛn, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />nek ke ba ki te yit ika, in bi tin sot yit kpiip awo. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Nek ni in rēn resek mo ni itɔmɔng ku kang, in woso rus yit ni kunanang. Ayet fok in shim na ba ki kam yit ni kurɔm azatse me awo tit nek in shim ba ki ki fam yit ni kukpin azanɛn, nɔng idɔng fi i yet ifi kutset bin ngɔnɔng idɔng fi i yet ifi iku. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Adakunom ice wu fɛ́ a mi ki nye yit nek ishesheng e yɔng, a mi ki nɔɔk yit Kabik wu fɛ ka yet ite nagang wu fɛ́ a ki yit yit mo sak ni ikyɛng fi ida bɛ ashon.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Nek anɔng, in bɛ̀ yit agap iyɛ, in rēn yit fok ni izen fi in rēn se yit ni irɔm azatse kang, in se yit yik-yik na aTisa, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />nek kutseet yit yet kufi inɔɔk atsak da kufi iyɛrɛ ayisi awo. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Ey, in bɛ yit ayɛ ting, nek idung se yɛɛt ni in ka na kam yit ni kurɔm kang, ni in bun yit ari yit azanɛn gung na aTisa yit. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Nek anɔng, ke ni in resek mo azatse a, ke ni in mi bun yit azanɛn, nta yit yet ni in ku tɛrɛk yit iyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Nek i se gbing-gbing ngma yit in bi nyeseng yit ashon Anet-Isheshek nek ishɔt. Nɔng kaangan bi shan izang wu kpaf ni kutomong fɛ́ a ra ni kutset kang, ke ni iyet itek a ke imaan e ayi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">AYeso sot inosong-ashi nate <optbreak /> Adakunom nɛ banet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Yɔkɔnɔng fi in bɛ yit nnyim aTisa, in nye nyɛk yit na banet na ba shan ifɛ̀ yit. Adakunom rēn kaakyɛ naton yit, awon hom yet fok iyin rēn yin anɔng na ayɛ yin bà. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Iyit tsin shim in bang tere yit ace yit ashon yin awo tit in shim in ki nɔɔk yin ikyɛng fi i di ki di yin ite nyɛk yit, nɔng i da sɛ yin ikyɛng fi i di ki tak yin bafi tsot ágɔm ni nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ayisi yɛrɛ da in yɔng fi in se ayɛt ayɛ awo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ke bakak di tɛ ba mi ki dɔn yit, idɔn e se nek Adakunom, ki in se yit ayɛt nhwyɛ yit, anɔng e se mok iyin. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Nek ishim Anet-Isheshek ye i tsin ki kɔk yit, iyit ma sok yit ane na ayɛ yit: Ke anet azining da kyem a ku nek banet kusum, a sot ngma yit in mi ku yit. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Iwu ku nek akaangan, nɔng bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni kutset, ba bi tɛ ba nye kusot ice bà awo tit na ba sot yɔk iwu yɔng fɛ́ aku ba tɛ ba ku donong.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Nkum yɔkɔnɔng sak ashon, in da ti mara yit akak ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ayisi yɛrɛ awo. A kin tsang se, iyit kin mara yit Anet-Isheshek na ayisi irɔm, yɔkɔnɔng in tun nye yit anɔng awo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Nek anɔng, ngma anet fɛ́ a se ayɛt Anet-Isheshek, a yet anet afas, nkyɔrɔk nzen mi gosok, di yin nkyɔrɔk nfas mi bɛ̀. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk nang ne na Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a bɛ̀ ni inosong-ashi nate yit ni iwu fi ine ni bɔk Anet-Isheshek. A tɛ a ki nɔɔk yit kutomong isaas banet ne ba ra inosong-ashi ni iwu. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Na anɔng wu Adakunom kin di ra inosong-ashi nate wu ne kazatse fi ine na Anet-Isheshek. A rawu dang fa anɛn fɛ́ ba mang ku ra ne, a ki won yit ifɛ́ itonoso banet irèn inosong-ashi me.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Nek anɔng, iyit yet yit batom Anet-Isheshek, Adakunom tsin cɛɛt na banet ni ntɔ yit. In tsin ra yit awon ni yin akuce Anet-Isheshek, won yin inosong-ashi ni i se nate yin ne Adakunom. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Akuce yit wu fɛ́ Adakunom ku sak a di sot anet inɛn, iwu fɛ́ a ki mang rēn inɛn awo, na anɔng wu, in di se yit tabat ashon Adakunom ayɛt Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Ayet kutomong fi in se yit ne gung ni iwu, in ra yit awon ni yin, i bi won yit itek fi i mi sɛ yin na Adakunom ni i sot abap awo. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Nek iwu fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Ni izen itonong angmishish hom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">in mi da fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">in kin da sɛ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">atuk isheshek.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Di yin, izen isɛ angmishish e yeng; yɔkɔnɔng wu ayet izen isheshek e.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Iyit di tes yit ikyɛng ikpas ni irèn akak awo, kɔn ba bi ki sɛ yit ni inɛn ni itomong yit. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Na akaakyi irèn tɛ bafi itomong Adakunom, in mi sak yit ni iyɛ yit fok: Ke ayɛt mgbang, ke ayɛt izot, ke ayɛt iyɔm, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />ke ayɛt itosok, ke ayɛt inyang, ke ayɛt idoro nhwyɛ, ke ayɛt itomong, ke ayɛt avit nda natuk, ke ayɛt nzong. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Ke ayɛt kusot kucɛ́l, ke ayɛt irēn, ayɛt akabɔk, ayɛt nggɔn ntek, ayɛt iras kutomong na Kabik aJɛrɛ, ayɛt atitup ishim; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />ayɛt kucɛɛt atsak, ayɛt kukyem Adakunom; nɛ ares itsom atsak ni ibɔk kuyak nɛ ni imen yit. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Ayɛt iratek fɛ́ ba ki nesek yit ni ibyes fɛ́ ba ki nyes yit e, ayɛt mbɔɔs fɛ́ ba ki nyes yit e ni itere fɛ́ ba ki nyes yit e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:8">Ba mi ki sok yit tɛ bafi mbɔɔs, ngma na anɔng iyit nyeseng yit naton atsak yit; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Banet ki rēn yit gyat, ngma na anɔng, ba ki sok yit tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba rēn awo, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin kus, di yin, in tsin ya yit kashon ni kutset, tɛ ba tsin ki nesek yit mgbang, ngma na anɔng ba mi ki fɛs yit awo. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayit kafa kawe, ngma na anɔng in se yit ayit ifeng, tɛ bakan ngma na anɔng, in sas banet dot sosok barum, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit ikyɛng, ngma na anɔng in bɛ̀ yit kaakyi ikyɛng.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Iyin banet aKorinti, iyit mi ki tak yin weshek, in mi ki tarak yin ayɛ yit. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Vit iyit ni ikikak ifi irade sak ni yin, iyin ba i rayin dang tarak ayɛ yin sak ni yit. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ni ikyɛng fi imi ki nye yin ne, won ni in cɛɛt ni iyin ti nnon yin, tarak ayɛ yin sak ni yit.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">I bi mon yin ice <optbreak /> na bafi nhwyi awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />I bi mon yin ice na bafi nhwyi awo. Nek akyɛ fi i mon kusot kutabat ni kusot anyas ɛ? Ke akyɛ fi imoon mgbey ni nhwyi yɛ? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Akyɛ ifidang fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek bɛ̀ nɛ aShetan ɛ? Ke akyɛ de fi imoon bafi ikuus nɛ bafi nhwyi ɛ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Akyɛ fi i mon karɔ isosok Adakunom nɛ karɔ nabannom ɛ? Nek iyin ba in yet yit karɔ isosok Adakunom atset; ti Adakunom di fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">&lt;&lt;In da sot gung ni bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">in da kat nate ba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">in da sot Adakunom bá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">wat iba da sot banet hom.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Nek anɔng, wuruk yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">nate bafi nhwyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Azɔk Bazɔk Adakunom fɛ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">kana kam yin ni iba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">i bi ra yin ikyɛng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">fi i se gbiridik awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">nɔng in da ki shan yin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ni mbɔk nfaa.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ama anɔng, imi da sot ada yin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">ni iyin sot yin nnon hom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">namatek na nanamang e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">aTisa wu a fɛrɛng anɔng.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Nek anɔng, nek ikyɛng fɛ́ ba mi tak yit, ábaruneng, won ni in kusu yit ace yit ne kaakyi kuri ikyɛng fi i da ki beseng yit nrɔm nɛ kabik, won ni in sot yit bafɛ́ ajɛrɛ ayɛt ngma ikyɛng fi in da nye yit, ni in foos yit nnyim Adakunom.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus nye iyɛ ikan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Ki tarak yit ayɛ yin. Iyit mi dun yit akak yin awo, in mi wɔrɔk yit akak awo, in mi mɔɔt yit akak awo. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Imi tsin cɛɛt anɔng nek in ki sɛ yin ni inɛn awo, nek in mi ki tak yin fok i se yin gung ni iyit, ke ayɛt iku ke ni kutset. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Imi bi ite iyɛ ni yin makiyi, in tsot kugwɔm ni yin, in bi imen iyɛ, ngma ni mgbang fi in tsin sɔ yit, iyɛ hom woso tɛrɛk kyɛk.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Izen fi in kin tsin ta yit na aMasedoniya, nrɔm yit ben makiyi. In tirik aze ifa, aza ifa, ba ki tsɛsɛk yit ni ifa amatse, nnyim ayɛt ayɛ yit. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Awɛt Adakunom fɛ́ a rēn di barasa bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi tun iyɛ, ki barang yit mo agap ni kubɛ́ aTitus, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />ayet nek kubɛ́ wu kyɛk awo tit nek ibarang agap fi iyin ku nye yin ne. Iwu ki tak yit iyɛ ingash kudi hom fi i bɛ̀ yin, nɛ kafa kawe fi i nye yin nek ikyɛng fi i te, nɛ anyɛk fi i nye yin nek irun ama hom, anɔng e di barang ifeng makiyi. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ki kufumung hom ki beseng yin ayɛ, i di shesheng iyɛ hom awo, ibeseng iyɛ yin e yet ifi kizen gyet kyɛk, ki in fin ki beseng yin iyɛ, ibeseng iyɛ me yet ni in ki sak yin ni itirik yin sak na Adakunom. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Wat yɔkɔnɔng, imi bɛ̀ kafa kakan, da nek ibeseng iyɛ yin awo, tit nek i nye yin kafa kawe me ni kuyiring ishesheng, Adakunom ma ra kutomong ne kafa kawe yin, a ki kurɔk yin mo sak ni wu, kɔn ibeseng bi di nɔ nate yit.<verse eid="2CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Nek kafa kawe Adakunom, bɛ́s ni ishesheng fi i saas isheshek. Ibeseng iyɛ kuri iyɔng won anet ni kuyiring fok, akyɛ sak in nye anɔng ɛ, awɛt kafa kawe kuri kufɛ́ azatse saas iku. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Kɔ di yin kuri atitup atsak fi ibeseng iyɛ Adakunom mi tes ayɛt yin. Ni iyɛ ingash, ni ishan inɛn yin, ni itonong kafa kawe yin, ni nnyim fi i tonong yin. Anɔng e ki sak yin ite iyɛ ni iyɛ ingash makiyi. I shim yin na ba tabak bayɔng fɛ́ ba dun. I mi tonong yin fok iyin se yin vit inɛn ayɛt ikyɛng fi i kin te awo. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ngma ni kufumung fi in kin ki jɛk yin ne, ku kin yet fok ba di tsɛt anet fɛ́ a nye inɛn ke ayɔng fɛ́ ba ku nye inɛn awo tit nek in ki tonong yin wɛshɛk fok Adakunom rēn fok iyin shim yin kukyang yit. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Nek anɔng, in bang sɛ yit agap.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Agap yit di barang kyɛk awo, in bang sɛ yit itɛrɛk iyɛ nek ifeng aTitus, nek ngma yin i mi ku sak yin a sot gbagba. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Nek ngma ikyɛng fi in ku tak naton yin, i di te yin nsum awo. Kyɔn tɛ ngma ikyɛng fi in ki tees yin yet atsak, kpaf anɔng fi iwu tse a sɛ ikyɛng fi in tak yit aTitus naton yin yet atsak. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ifeng fɛ́ aTitus bɛ̀ sak ni yin bang di barasa, ngma izen fɛ́ a yiring ni ifok ifɛ̀ fi i bɛ̀ yin, ne fi i ku shan yin ni nnyim ni inɔɔk iratek. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Imi bɛ̀ itɛrɛk iyɛ, nek in bɛ̀ atitup ite iyɛ ni yin.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Inesek bafi ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Ábaruneng, in shim yit ni i rēn yin ikyɛng fi kunang Adakunom tsin nye na bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se na aMasedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Ngma ni imara fɛ́ ba di sɛ ice bá ayɛt makiyi, ba yet bakan kpɛt-kpɛt, ba woso nesek ni itɛrɛk iyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Nek ba nesek kpaf na agap bà, ba nesek kashon ni kukyem ba, ni ishim iyɛ bà. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Ba ra awon ni yit gyet awo, fok ni in ka ba won yit na ba sɛ awɛng bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin nesek nek banet Adakunom. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Awɛt ba nye ti ite iyɛ yit awo, tit ba tung nabak ace bà sak na aTisa ninyɛn, ama anɔng, ba da nɛ ba nabak ace bà sak ni yit ni kushim Adakunom. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Na anɔng wu in di fɛ̀ yit na aTitus na a ya kashon ni itusung nnang ite iyɛ fi iwu na gang ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi tsang tumung ni yin. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Awɛt fi i mi kɔrɔk yin kashon na kaakyi ikyɛng, ni inesek atsak, ni icɛɛt, ni irēn nkyɔrɔk, ni iyɛ ngash inesek, ni ishim yin sak ni iyit. Nek anɔng, te nyɛk yin da sot yin kashon bakak.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Imi tsin ki te yin agbing awo, tit in shim in ki tonong yin iyɛ ngash fɛ́ bakak bɛ̀, nɔng i da sot fok ishim yin yet atitup e. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Nek iyin rēn yin itek fɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi ki tonong yit, ngma ni kurúm fɛ́ a bɛ̀, a wosong iko nek iyin, a da bin sot akan, nɔng ayɛt ikan wu, iyin bin sot yin barum. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Itabak fi imi da ki nɔk yin yet: Ni iyɛ ida, iyin ba i kin tumung yin inesek e kyɛk awo. I kin nesek yin nek ishim iyɛ yin. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Nek anɔng, gang yin ikyɛng fi imang tumung yin kong. Nɔng i da bin tonong yin fok iyɛ ngash inesek fi ibɛ yin se kpaf na agap isɛ yin. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Nek ki iyɛ ngash e di se, ikyɛng fɛ́ anet nɔk mi sɛ ku shan, Adakunom shim anet na a nɔɔk ikyɛng fi vit iwu ni ide awo.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Da imi tsin fɛ̀ ye bakak na ba sot vit kunanang, na ba bin ki won yin iyin acet awo, tit ni se yin gbigbong. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ise yɛɛt ni i ka ba sɛs yin mo ayɛt ikyɛng fi i bɛ̀ yin yɔkɔnɔng, nɔng izen fi iba bi bɛ́ ba sɛ dot bá, ba bi ki sɛ yin mo bá. Na anɔng fi idi ki se yin gbigbong e. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Kpaf ti i di se ni ijɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">&lt;&lt;Anet fɛ́ a tusung hwiu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 8:15">vit ikyɛng fi i ku tuk mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">Ayɔng fɛ́ a tusung gyegyet,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 8:15">a bit ikikak awo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Iwuruk 16:18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">ATitus na bafidang itomong wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />In bɛ iyɛ ikan na Adakunom, fɛ́ a sak aTitus te nyɛk igbingding yin ti iyit shim yit. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ayet fok a shim ibɛ́ ni yin nek iyit ku sak yit mo awo tit nek ishim iyɛ wu. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />In da tom yit aruneng yit fɛ́ ba da bɛ́ gung nɛ aTitus, anet fɛ́ a mi nye iyerek na atu iya ntong nek ishara ifɛ̀ itek. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Nkum anɔng kyɛk awo, bafi ikuus ku kasa na moon mbɔk ni in teng in ra yit kutomong itusung inesek ite iyɛ yeng fi i da bi ni itere sak na aTisa. Na anɔng wu in di ki tonong yit fok in bɛ yit iyɛ ingash in kaba sɛ yit mo. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Iyit sok yit irèn iyɔng, kɔn akak bi sɛ ikyɛng icɛɛt naton kunang ite iyɛ ikan fɛ́ ba ki te yit mo. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ishim iyɛ yit yet fok ni in nye yit ikyɛng fi ida tseng gyat, da ashon Adakunom kyɛk awo, ngma ashon banet awe.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Gung ni iba me, in da yirik aruneng yit akak, anet fi iyit mi di yit kukyem wu ni irèn dot-dot. Yɔkɔnɔng fɛ́ a mi ki sok yin ni iyɛ wu, a bi iyɛ ingash kutomong e makiyi. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Rēn yin fok aTitus yet afidang itomong hom, a tsin ra kutomong fi imi ku sak mo nate yin. Baruneng yit bafaa bang yet batom fɛ́ bafi ikuus kasa, iba da nye ikyɛng fi i da bɛ́ ni iratek na Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nek anɔng, nye yin ikyɛng fi i da tonong bafi ikuus ishim fi i bɛ́ yin, ni ikyɛng fi i da ki kusu yit nek itsot kugwɔm fi in mi nye yit akuce yin.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Inesek nek igbingding bafi ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />I se gbing-gbing ma in ki jɛk yin ne naton inesek nek bafi ikuus awo. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Nek imi rēn iyɛ ingash fi i bɛ̀ yin, fi i mi di sak in mi tsot kugwɔm nek iyin ashon banet aMasedoniya, in ka ba tak fok banet Akaya mang kana nye neme ni iyɛ ida ifi inesek e. Iyɛ ingash yin, tsi i rumung kudot banet bà. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Awɛt in tsin tom baruneng bang, kɔn itsot kugwɔm fi in mi nye yit akuce yin, ni i sot ifɛ́ abap ni icɛɛt e, yɔk in shim yit ni i kana nye yin gyam kpaf ti ikyɛng fi in mi fɛ̀. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Ke da anɔng awo, ke bakak ayɛt banet aMasedoniya di run kama sak azɔng, ba bɛ́ ba sɛ imi kana nye yin awo. Imi bi sɔ nsum nek itsot anu fi in mi tsang ra akuce yin, ama anɔng, imi azi hom kyɛk fi in bi sɔ nsum e awo, ma gung ni iyin. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Nek anɔng, in di i se gyat ni in tung yirik baruneng bang sak azɔng ni yin, nɔng ba bin tusung ikyɛng fi i mi fɛ̀ i da nesek yin, anɔng e da tonong ishim iyɛ yin ayet inesek e, vit agbing ni de.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anet fɛ́ a nesek ni ishim iyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Yiring yin fok: ngma anet fɛ́ a tuus ija wu ni imak, a bi tusung nayak imak wu, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tuus ni mbɔk washak, a bi tusung nayak wu sherek. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Kaangan na nɔk ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi sak ni iyɛ wu a da nɔk, vit karut ke agbing-gbing awo, nek Adakunom shim anet fɛ́ a nesek ni ishim iyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Adakunom kyem a ki nɔk yin kunang ira ikyɛng fi itsɛt yin washak, nɔng kaakyi izen i da sɛs yin ngma ikyɛng fi itsɛt yin nek i di ya yin kashon gbingding bakak. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kpaf ti i di se ni ijɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;A mi nesek bakan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">ni kubɔk washak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">wat kunang wu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">bi nkum awo.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Abom 112:9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Adakunom wu a nesek anet ikap ija, iwu wu a tɛ nesek akaangan nayak. Nek anɔng, a da ki nɔk yin ija fi i da tuus yin, a da tɛ sak ija yin ni i rasak, na anɔng wu a da te inesek ishim iyɛ da ki barang yin mo itek ayit kutomong kutek yin. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />A da ki te yin awɛng na akaakyi irèn nɔng i da nesek yin ni kubɔk washak, nɔng banet dot bin tere Adakunom ni izen fi in ka ba kabasa yin ares e. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Nek kutomong inesek ti ku kang, yet itarasa kudaam banet kyɛk awo, ibɛ́s ni itere Adakunom na banet dot. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Kuri inesek yeng ni ifok ifɛ yin, mi tonong kuri banet fi i yet yin. Anɔng e, da sak banet dot di nɔɔk Adakunom iratek. Nek inesek e sak ishara ifɛ́ Anet-Isheshek ayɔng fi iyin di nɔɔk yin atsak. Ama anɔng, kuri kuwashak e kang fi iyin ka ba ra yin ne ni ishɛrɛp banet. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Yɔkɔnɔng ba tsin ki ra yin awon, ni iyɛ ingash kudi yin, nek kunang Adakunom fi ku wat kaakyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Won in tere yit Adakunom nek kunang kang fi ku wat agap icɛɛt.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">ABulus tsin cɛɛt nɛ bafi ifa ni wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Imi ice hom aBulus, in tsin ra awon ni yin nek imen nhwyɛ ni ice ikyang Anet-Isheshek. Imi yet anet fɛ́ ba cɛɛt fok in bi nhwyɛ kin in ki di ayisi na ayisi. Awɛt ki in won karɔ yin ni in cɛɛt na agap, vit nnyim. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />In tsin ra awon ni yin fok, i bi di sak yin ni in cɛɛt nya-nyat izen fi in bi bɛ́ awo, nek imi rēn in da kyem in di tik naton bayɔng fɛ́ ba nye fok ikyɛng fi in nye yit yet nggɔn banet azatse. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ngma ni fi in se yit ni irɔm, in ras itsom yit tɛ bafi irɔm awo. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Nek ares itsom yit yet afi irɔm awo, tit anyin-anyin e fɛ̀ Adakunom nesek, fi in di nyɔ yit ace ngma bafi ifa ni iyit. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />In di bara yit kaakyi kuri nanan, nɛ akaakyi kuri ikyɛng fi iceshek ice ayɛt iraye irēn Adakunom, in saas yit banet kuyiring ifoos ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Imi kana nye yit in da tabak yit bayɔng fɛ́ ba raba ifoos ifɛ̀, ki iyin shim yin i da fok yin ifɛ̀.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Iyin yɛrɛ yin nkyɔrɔk na ayisi da di yin. Ke akak ayɛt yin di fok iwu yet afɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek, na a bang yiring ice wu fok kpaf ti iwu di yet afɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek, iyit yɔng anɔng bá. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Ngma ni itsot kugwɔm fi in nye makiyi naton kukyem fɛ́ aTisa di nɔk mok in ki nok yin mo, da nek in ki kɔk yin sak ama awo, imi bɛ̀ ikyɛng nsum awo. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Imi shim afumung hom na a sot tɛ afi ibara nasok ni iyɛ awo. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Nek ba nye fok, &lt;&lt;Afumung wu nanang, a bɛ̀ agap, awɛt ke a bɛ́ ashon yit na cɛɛt kpuu, kucɛɛt wu me ye kye, ikyɛng ibyɛs.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Won banet e na ba rēn fok vit ikyɛng fi in man ki jɛk yin ne na afumung iyit vit azɔng ni iyin, fi i se zɛɛt ni idɔng fi in ki tas yin ayisi na ayisi.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Iyit kyem yit ni in mara yit ace yit na bayɔng fɛ́ ba kok ace bà fok iba wat bakak awo. Bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsɛt imara ace bà nɛ bakak, na ba shim ba tonoso kuzɛɛt bà, ba yet ashɔp. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Awɛt iyit da tsot yit kugwɔm nin got yit nkum e awo. Tit nin tsot yit kugwɔm yit sak nkum arɔ fɛ́ Adakunom ki bɔ yit e, in di ra yit kutomong. Ni in di ta yit sak ni yin. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Iyit mi shorop yit nkum iyit itsot kugwɔm yit naton yin tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ won dang bɛ́ ni yin awo, nek iyit ba in yet yit bafi imɛsɛng fi in ki bɛ́ yin ni ishara ifɛ̀ Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Itsot kugwɔm itomong yit, mi got nkum awo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 10:15">Ite iyɛ yit yet fok, inɔɔk atsak yin, ni ibang ya kashon, nɔng in da bang sɛ yit kawat ibarang kutomong nate yin. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Ama anɔng, in da tsin in shara yit ifɛ̀ itek e ni mben nkak ashon ni nfiin, na narɔ fɛ́ vit iyit ni itsot kugwɔm naton kutomong fɛ́ bakak man ra. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Kpaf ti fi i di se ni ijɛk ni ifumung Adakunom ye, &lt;&lt;Won ayɔng fɛ́ a da tsot kugwɔm, na a nye anɔng ayit ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa mi nye.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:24">ARimiya 9:24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Nek itere fɛ́ anet nyes ice wu ne fɛ́ ba di ras kutomong awo, tit ayɔng fɛ́ aTisa tere.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">ABulus ne batom mbɔɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Nye yin akabɔk ni ishɔp hom gyegyet, imi rēn i da nye yin anɔng! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Imi bi ifup naton yin ti idɔng fɛ́ Adakunom bɛ́, in mi ki kasa yin sak na amatek azining ti ica anamang fɛ anet isam ka me, yet aKristi. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Awɛt nnyim hom yet fok da ba bi ki wɔrɔk yin tɛ fi ihwyen nborok kin di wɔrɔk aHauwa awo, in fok nnyim kɔng ba bi tirik ayɛ yin, ni won yin inabak iyɛ yin sak na Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Nek ke anet akak ki bɛ́ yin ni ishara naton aYeso akak zɛɛt na ayɔng fi iyit mi ki tak yin, ke a ki bɛ́ yin na kabik kakak zɛɛt nɛ ka yɔng fi ki mang shan yin, ke ni ishara ikak zɛɛt ni iyɔng fi i ki mang shan yin ayi, ni ti ni feng yin ni iye makiyi.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Awɛt imi di ikyɛng fɛ́ bayɔng fi i ka ba yes yin ye, &lt;&lt;agbat-batom&gt;&gt; e di wat ni ide awo. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Nyen in rēn cɛɛt ashon banet awo, awɛt in se kpuu ni irēn nkyɔrɔk awo, in mi ki tonong yin anɔng e na akaakyi irèn.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />In nye inɛn fi in men ni nhwyɛ hom, in ki nesek yin iratek, in ki shara yin ifɛ̀ itek Adakunom vit ishan itarang ikak ni yin ɛ? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />In sak kunanang na bafi ikuus bakak, in shashang itsɔm ni ba, nek in ki ra yin mo kutomong. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Ngma kusot in azɔng ni iyin, in mang idi sɛ yin mo ni ikikak ni izen fi in tsɛt itsɔm awo, bafi ikuus banyining nɛ batek fɛ́ ba nes na aMasedoniya ba fɛ̀ ba di nes ni ikyɛng fi in shim. Kpaf ti in kin di tumung, sak ashon, imi da sot acet ni yin awo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Na atsak Anet-Isheshek ayɛt hom, imi mi di anet fɛ́ a di ki ro ni itsot kugwɔm naton ikyɛng deng ni mben Akaya ngma kusum awo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />In tsin ra anɔng fok nek in ki shim yin awɛ? Adakunom wu fɛ́ a rēn in ki ishim yin fi in bɛ mok iyin.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Imi da ya kashon ni ra ikyɛng fi tsin ra me ni ramin ishashang nkyɔrɔk ni yin, nɔng banet e yɔng bin bit ikyɛng itsot kugwɔm fok iba se nagbɔng ti iyit. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Nek banet e yɔng, yet batom mbɔɔs, bafi kutomong iboroso banet, ba shesheng nse bá fok iba yet batom Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ayet ikyɛng yɔɔt awo, nek aShetan ice wu, a shesheng ice wu tɛ atomaza mgbey. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Nek anɔng, iyet ikyɛng ifas awo ke basam aShetan tirik ace bá tɛ bafɛ́ ntomong isot kutabat. Ki izen nye, ba bi sɛ izang fi i se kpaf ni ntomong bá.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus tsot kugwɔm ni sɔ mgbang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />In shim in bang fɛ́ ane, akak bi di sok fok in yet kushɔp awo, ki iyin di sok yin anɔng, ni wes yin ato ni imi kyɔn tɛ ba di foos ishɔp, nɔng in di ki sɛ ikyɛng itsot kugwɔm gyat. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Da ifɛ́ itsot kugwɔm deng yet ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa di te mo awo tit ikyɛng fi in tsin cɛɛt ti ishɔp. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />In di fok banet dot tsɛt itosok kugwɔm ni irɔm, imi da tsot kugwɔm bà. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Iyit yet yin batsitsɛng, nek anɔng i da kyem i nye yin akabɔk na ashɔp. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />I da nye yin akabɔk na banet fɛ́ ba ki sas yin isam, ke ba ki mɔɔt yin, ba ya ikyɛng fi iyet ifiin ayi. Ke a ki byɛs yin, ke a ki rus yin kubɔk na yisi ayi. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />I di yet ikyɛng nsum ni ifɛ́ fok nkyɔrɔk yɔng kin ki gaat yit.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Awɛt ke akak tsot kugwɔm naton ikikak, imi ma in da nye iyɛ in da nye anɔng bà. In tsin cɛɛt ifɛ deng ti ishɔp. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Iba yet baYahuda yɛ? Imi ma in yet azining. Iba yet bafɛ́ aIsrela yɛ? Imi ma in yet azining, Iba yet nnon aIbrahim ɛ? Imi ma in yet azining. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Iba yet basam Anet-Isheshek yɛ? I se kpaf ni in cɛɛt anɔng awo, awɛt in se kashon ni iba azaton isam nek Anet-Isheshek. In mi sɔ mgbang ni itomong, ba mi di famasa ari inyang ni izen dot, ba mi di tsosok ne ahwyereng izen dot, in mi nyiis ni iku izen dot. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ite katoon, bakɔk-ashon baYahuda mi di nesek ahwyereng nsɔk ntaat na agyɛng azining. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ite kataat, igwɔm aRoma mi sak ba di tsosok ne anyin ishɛn, bafi ifa ni imi mi di bara na ata kazining, ite kataat kukyɛ ashi mi fo ni imi ayɛt e, in mang kɔsɔ, in ti in di woso ayit izek, ba da ne ba bɛ́ ba di tun.<verse eid="2CO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ayit ntseet zizɛɛt fi in nyes, in mi sɔ mgbang na ákyɛk, ni mgbang ne bakpatang agap. In mi sɔ mgbang ni bɔk bafi icɛn inaan, in mi sɔ mgbang ni bɔk bafi Ícɛn-iduk. In mi sɔ mgbang ayit iwɔp, in sɔ mgbang ayɛt ayit, in mi sɔ mgbang nate izek, in mi sɔ mgbang ni bɔk bafi ikuus mbɔɔs. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />In mi bɔrɔng ni kutomong makiyi, in mi kɔs vit nda, in mi sosok ni nzong ni iyɛ ingash, izen ikak vit nayak, izen ikak ni wun vit ikyɛng ifam irɔm. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ama nyɔng, kaakyi kunom, kunanang ndaam bafi ikuus ngma kusum se naton hom. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Ke akak se gbɛrɛk ayɛt yin, na di te gbɛrɛk bà, ke akak ayɛt yin kpa ni inɛn, na di shining ne kafa kawe.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ki i se gbingbing ni in tsot kugwɔm, in da nye anɔng ayit nkyɔrɔk fi in tonoso kurat hom. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Ada, ada aTisa aYeso, won na ba tere iyerek wu! Iwu rēn fok imi tsin tas mbɔɔs awo. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ni izen e yɔng, anet fɛ́ a yet ayisi agwɔm Aretas na aDamaskos, sak na ba famasa natisi iwɔp aDamasin e, nɔng ba di ki yit mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Awɛt ba di tun ni iwere na akwɔmɔng ni kubat iwɔp e, in hwet ni bɔk wu.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />In rēn fok vit ikyɛng fi in da sɛ ayɛt e, in da ya kashon ni itsot kugwɔm. Yɔkɔnɔng, in da ya kashon ni kucɛɛt naton nabos abik ni itarak ice fɛ́ aYeso mi di tonong. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Imi rēn afi ikuus akak fɛ́ ayɛ kusɔk abe anaas, ba kin ku sok sak azanɛn ka fɛ́ ataat. Ikyɛng fi in nin rēn awo yet, ke ba kin ku sok ni irɔm a, ke ni irɔm awo ayi. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Won in bang fɛ̀ ye, Adakunom wu kyɛk fɛ́ a rēn fok ba kin sok anet e ni irɔm ke ni irɔm awo ayi. Imi rēn awo, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />a foos nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ a da kyem in tak awo, nyɔng fɛ́ vit anet fɛ́ a da kyem a fɛrɛng ina. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />In tsot kugwɔm naton anet tɛ ayɔ́ng, awɛt in da tsot kugwɔm ni ice min awo, tit nin in tsot kugwɔm naton kurat hom. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ki imi fi in shim itsot kugwɔm, ki in nye ti ishɔp awo, nek in da cɛɛt atsak. Imi da tsot kugwɔm awo, kɔng akak bi dung di sok garang azaton ikyɛng fi in nye ki in fɛ́ ayi.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Nek da in bi kok ice naton kudot nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ Adakunom mi di tonong, ba di te kurɔk fi ku sot ti itsitsan ni irɔm. Tɛ asam aShetan fɛ́ ba sak na a di nesek iyɔm, kɔng in bi kok ice. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ite kataat, in tsɛsɛk aTisa ni a di tun iko. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Awɛt iwu fɛ̀ ni imi; &lt;&lt;Itek hom da kyem, nek kukyem hom nes ayit kurat ngɔn.&gt;&gt; Nek anɔng, in da bang nye itɛrɛk iyɛ, ni itsot kugwɔm ayɛt kurat hom, nɔng kukyem Anet-Isheshek da sot gung ni imi. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Nek anɔng, imi bi iyɛ ikan ayɛt kurat hom, ayɛt ncɛɛt ibyes fɛ́ ba di nyes e, ayɛt mgbang, ayɛt izot, ni nzam-nzam iyɔm fi in di ses nek Anet-Isheshek. Nek izen fi in se gbɛrɛk, ni izen e yɔng, ni in ses agap.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />In mi borok ice min, iyin ba i di sak yin mo. Ki iyin ba ningya fi i di tere yin, ngma ni fi da in kyem ikikak awo, in wat bayɔng fi i ka ba yes yin, agbat-agbat batom. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ni izen fi in se gung ni iyin, in nyes nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba tsɛt na atom aYeso, nek ayɛt akabɔk, in ras ntomong ajingjing, ni ntomong abes nate yin. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Na ane fi kurat yin kin di ne aza bafi ikuus bakak ɛ? Tit nek in ramin dang ki te yin kunanang. Di nye yin akabɔk nek inɛn dɔng!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Kyɔrɔng, in mi kana nye in da ki bɛ́ yin itsen afɛ́ ataat, in bi ki te yin kunanang awo, nek ikyɛng fi imi shim ni yin yet ikyɛng ibɔk yin awo tit iyin ice yin. In rēn yit fok da nnon na tsɛt kurúm nek bada bà awo tit bada ba ba tsɛt nnon bà ne. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />In da nye iyɛ ikan ni in wey nɛ akaakyɛ fi in bɛ, ngma ni ice hom, nɔng in ki sɛ yin mo. I di ki shim yin gyet, nek imi ki shim yin dot ɛ?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ngɔn rēn fok da imi ki sak yin kunanang awo. Awɛt akak da kyem a fɛ̀ fok imi ki ra yin kutsitsɛng, in ki te yin agunung mbɔɔs. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Na anɛ fi in ki mɔɔt yin ni irèn atom akak ayɛt banet fi in kin ka ba tom sak ni yin ɛ? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />In kin ra awon na aTitus na a bɛ azɔng in ku moon na aruneng. Iyin da fɛ́ yin aTitus e ki mɔɔt yin ɛ? Ke iwu ni imi in bɛ́ yit kabik kazining awɛ, ke in nye yit nkyɔrɔk ni irèn izining awɛ?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Bacɛk iyɛ hom, gyan bakak da di fok in tsɛt yin irèn itɛnɛsɛ ace yit ashon yin. Kye awey o! Iyit ra yit ni in cɛɛt yit kaakyɛ fɛ́ aYeso Kristi shim ni in raas yit ni in taas yit ashon Adakunom, in ki barasa yin mo agap. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Nek in teng fok, izen fi in bɛ́, in da ki sɛ yin ni irèn fi imi da shim awo. Iyin bà gyan ni di sɛ yin ni irèn fi da i shim yin awo. In teng in kɔn ifa, ifup, inye fuu, i kana kabasa, tɛm icɛɛt, itang anu, ikok ice ni kperedyɛng bi di se. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />In teng in fok, izen fi in ti bɛ, Adakunom hom di sak ni in men ice hom ashon yin. In bi bɛ kafa kawe na banet dot fɛ ba mi raas anɛn yaame. Da ba mi tirik ba wosong nkyɔrɔk e fi in ka ba sak gbiridik, ti kujang, ni nggɔn nduk e fɛ ba ras. Da ba nɛ ba tirik ba wosong nkyɔrɔk e nang awo, nkyɔrɔk fi in ka ba sak ba sot gbiridik, nɛ ni iras kujang, ni nggɔn nduk e fɛ ba man na ba ras ina.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto nɛ ashow igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Kubɛ́ itsen hom kufɛ́ ataat kang sak ni yin. &lt;&lt;Kaakyi kucɛɛt mi sot anɔng. Ke ba fok iko nanu banet bafaa ke bataat ayi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Iyɛrɛk Ntsi 19:15</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Imi man ki kɔrɔk yin kuto ni izen fi in kin se ni iyin ni kubɛ́ hom kufɛ́ afaa. In tsin tin ki taas yin ni imi vit azɔng ni iyin: Ki in bun azɔng, in bi won bayɔng fɛ́ ba kin ra inɛn ida nɛ bakak fɛ́ ba tɛ ba ra ikak awo. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Ki itsɛt irèn yin fok ke Anet-Isheshek cɛɛt nanu hom ɛ. Iwu rat ayɛt ikyɛng fɛ́ a se ne nate yin awo, tit a tsin tonoso kukyem wu nate yin. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Nek i di rēn yin, ba kin ku tekak gbɛrɛk, ngma na anɔng a se ni kutset ayɛt kukyem Adakunom. Kpaf anɔng, iyit se yit gbɛrɛk ni wu, ngma na anɔng, ayɛt kukyem Adakunom, in da sot ni iwu in ra yin kutomong.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mara yin ace yin da di yin, ki i ren resek yin ni inɔɔk atsak ɛ? Maas yin ice yin da di yin ke i ren se yin ayɛt atsak yin ɛ. Maas ice yin, rēn yin fok Anet-Isheshek aYeso se ayɛt yin awɛ, tit ki i mi kpa yin imaas e yɛ? <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ite iyɛ hom yet fok ni i rēn yin fok da iyit kpa yit imaas e awo. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Yɔkɔnɔng in se yit na awon sak na Adakunom, fok da i bi nye yin ikyikak iduk e awo. Ayet fok in shim yit banet da ki di yit fok in nyeseng yit imara me awo, tit ni ira yin ikyɛng fi i se gyat ke i di yin ti in dun yit ayi. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Nek iyit da kyem in ra yit ikyikak fi da in ra ide atsak awo, tit idɔng fi i yet atsak. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />In bɛ yit itɛrɛk iyɛ, ngma izen fi in se yit gbɛrɛk, ni yin se yin gbagba; awon yit yet fok ni se yin gyatgyat. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Nek anɔng wu fi isak in di jɛk nkyɔrɔk nang ni imi vit azɔng, nɔng kin in bɛ́ in da mak sot fulul ayet ira kutomong ni kukyem hom awo. Kukyem fɛ́ Adakunom di nɔk nek in di nok yin mo da nek in di sarak yin mo awo.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashow afi igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ábaruneng, ni igang e, te yin ice nek kusot kutek, fok yin awon hom, sot yin bafi kuyiring kuzining, sot yin kyang. Adakunom fɛ́ a nesek ishim ni kusot kukyang da se gung ni iyin. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Nye show yin bafidang ayɛt ashow ajɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Ngma banet Adakunom ki te show yin.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Won kunang aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, ni ishim Adakunom, ni imoon ice Kabik aJɛrɛ na ka sot gung ni iyin ngma.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>